  "reason": "Existing evidence shows scvi_n200 outperforms other RNA encoders in multiprofile settings, but no image-only experiments have been tested. This experiment tests image-only models with resnet50, a standard image encoder, to determine if image modality alone can achieve competitive performance. This clarifies the importance of image data and provides critical evidence for whether multimodal approaches are necessary, aligning with the principle of balancing exploration and exploitation."
}

